:INFO
Art. 38a Labelling of specific biocidal products classified as dangerous
Where a biocidal product is placed on the market that is classified as dangerous within the meaning of Article 3 ChemO because of the physical or health hazards it presents, the authorisation holder must not only indicate the information in accordance with Article 38 paragraphs 2–4 but also the UFI in accordance with the provisions of Article 15a paragraphs 3 and 4 ChemO.
|

:NOTE
Art. 38a — Inserted by No I of the O of 18 Nov. 2020 (AS 2020 5125). Amended by No I of the O of 15 Nov. 2023, in force since 1 Jan. 2024 (AS 2023 709).
SR 813.11
